le and Pokémon were to\\fcome here with something linked to\\fHO-OH... It may come down for such\\fa person...\\r","msg_0057_D17R0101_00002":"That thing you have...!\\r","msg_0057_D17R0101_00003":"You have done it...\\nPlease come through.","msg_0057_D17R0101_00004":"That Rainbow Wing will merely permit you\\nto go up the tower.\\rIf you are not the kind of person who\\nwould restore the trust between people\\fand Pokémon, HO-OH will never show\\fitself to you...","msg_0057_D17R0101_00005":"Hmmm.\\rSo it was you and the Bell!","msg_0057_D17R0101_00006":"You are quite a remarkable Trainer\\nfor your age...","msg_0057_D17R0101_00007":"Morty: Bell Tower is where\\npeople and Pokémon test their trust.\\rYou may be born with some talent...\\fCan we exchange numbers?\\rI would love to examine the trust\\nyou have with your Pokémon. {YESNO 0}","msg_0057_D17R0101_00008":"{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} registered Morty\\nin the Pokégear!","msg_0057_D17R0101_00009":"Morty: Give me a call on Tuesday nights.\\nI should be free and ready.","msg_0057_D17R0101_00010":"Morty: I really wanted to see the\\ntrust you have with your Pokémon...","msg_0057_D17R0101_00011":"Morty: Do you want to exchange\\nnumbers? {YESNO 0}"},"initTriggers":[],"initScripts":{},"constants":{"_EV_scr_seq_D17R0101_000":0,"_EV_scr_seq_D17R0101_001":1,"_EV_scr_seq_D17R0101_002":2,"obj_D17R0101_bozu":0}}
